### Environment / secrets ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Symfony env files are versioned (they hold dev-only defaults, never secrets)
!backend/.env
!backend/.env.*
# ...except the local ones, which may contain real secrets
backend/.env.local
backend/.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

